# Data: h polynomial approximations

## `coeffs.csv`

Dense matrix of Chebyshev coefficients exported from `MathematicaImplementationV8 For DanielAndCo.nb`, with row `m+1` and column `n+1` equal to the coefficient of `T_m(2x-1) T_n(1-2y)` on `[0,1]^2`. Equivalently, on the square inside the hexagon `[0,1] x [-1,0]`, the same coefficients give `T_m(2x-1) T_n(2Y+1)` after the substitution `Y = -y`.

## `polyCheb.mx`

Legacy Mathematica `DumpSave` artifact from `MathematicaImplementation For DanielEllieWill.nb`.
